{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：10:58 2026-09-23 HKT</p>\n\n<p>天水圍驚現浮屍。今日（23日）早上9時13分，一名男子被發現在天瑞徑對開河中載浮載沉。人員到場將他救起，惜事主已當場死亡。消息稱，死者是一名失蹤人士，早前離家後不知所終，其家人報案。警方證實死者是60歲黃男子，失蹤人口組亦到場，正調查事件原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"墮河男子當場死亡，警員在場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/debae9b0f545cae2ce898b16ab58fbb4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_10_22_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/020f68d41cc844a4f4a8ae381415bf6e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_10_22_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4fb633e7ac4787198799d57696345a3/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_10_22_37_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子被發現在天瑞徑對開河中載浮載沉，已當場死亡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4cf9553a1a04a12c245a76f938ad9206/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_10_24_07.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f91e15fa5a84f4095abc005b79bd550/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_10_24_06.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc163b27a05f040ef62f5b062ecd429c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_10_24_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48280ee39355ba6c086068b1fc2f7709/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-23_at_10_24_08.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T04:58:55.768584+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}